put on the newsgroups ... I hope the answer is not too simple ....

When I boot the workstation (Alpha workstation) from the CD-ROM
installation disk (OS = v3.2c), I get to the single-user mode. The /
directory is mounted on /dev/md0a which if guess means it is loaded into
memory (md = memory device ?). The /kit directory is mounted on the
CD-ROM.

Then, to my surprise, there are no floppy devices created by default in
