my tape drive.

The only (improbable) answer I have been able to figure out is that the
vmunix kernel loaded from the CD-ROM disk has not defined the floppy disk
controller in the kernel configuration file .... which I think would be
very strange ...

Any information on the subject ? ....

Thanks very much.

